<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<p id="demoNarration" style="margin:0;font-size:11px;max-width:280px">The curve starts at its minimum: two H atoms 74 pm apart sit at the lowest energy, with the spheres just touching. This balance of attraction and repulsion is the covalent bond.</p>
